{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"75afd24cd483ff51377eca5e5f09697cae4183505fe32b77f9a055afc3c29407","slug":"howto-panel","location":"/content/howto_panel.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Manual de Integración: Simuladores Interactivos (Panel/Pyodide) en Jupyter Book (MyST)","content_includes_title":false,"open_access":true,"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International","free":true,"CC":true}},"github":"https://github.com/miguelmartfern/SIL-JB","math":{"\\SF":{"macro":"\\quad \\overset{\\text{SF}}{\\longrightarrow} \\quad"},"\\sen":{"macro":"\\operatorname{sen}"},"\\sinc":{"macro":"\\operatorname{sinc}"}},"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"howto_panel.md","url":"/SIL-JB/build/howto_panel-5af29523ccb22d089cc0a299b9ef95f8.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Este manual detalla cómo programar, compilar e incrustar una aplicación web de análisis de señales (usando Python, SymPy y Panel) dentro de un Jupyter Book (v2). El objetivo es que se ejecute íntegramente en el navegador del alumno mediante WebAssembly, sin requerir un servidor Python en producción, y que pueda publicarse fácilmente en GitHub Pages o UVaDoc como Recurso Educativo Abierto (REA).","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"fzBPq8tKWD"}],"key":"LXm5bOykpm"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Requisitos Previos","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"MBREEdj2jr"}],"identifier":"requisitos-previos","label":"Requisitos Previos","html_id":"requisitos-previos","implicit":true,"key":"eJ79gmSwFp"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Asegurarse de tener instalado el siguiente software en tu entorno local:","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"gsWxbaggIq"}],"key":"msLbFgQA0K"},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","value":"pip install panel bokeh sympy numpy jupyter-book","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"ozYgUy2GQN"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Fase 1: Creación y Compilación de la Aplicación","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"DT2NMAW4Fm"}],"identifier":"fase-1-creaci-n-y-compilaci-n-de-la-aplicaci-n","label":"Fase 1: Creación y Compilación de la Aplicación","html_id":"fase-1-creaci-n-y-compilaci-n-de-la-aplicaci-n","implicit":true,"key":"V7axfEArSe"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Paso 1.1: Organizar el directorio","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"JbiU3ZmpOO"}],"identifier":"paso-1-1-organizar-el-directorio","label":"Paso 1.1: Organizar el directorio","html_id":"paso-1-1-organizar-el-directorio","implicit":true,"key":"qtZqImJcOy"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"En la raíz del proyecto (por ejemplo, ","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"bpf3tqON2m"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"~/git/SIL-JB","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"x9xzro9oCp"},{"type":"text","value":"), asegurarse de tener una carpeta para el código fuente (ej. ","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"eknMBmgzs2"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"utils/","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"VePW1aAbtj"},{"type":"text","value":") y crear la carpeta pública donde MyST espera encontrar los recursos estáticos.","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"vE20NcSGUJ"}],"key":"E0zeGpdgRZ"},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","value":"# Crear la carpeta de estáticos en la raíz del proyecto\nmkdir -p public","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"key":"zCrNZ5GPOz"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Paso 1.2: Escribir el código de la aplicación (Panel)","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"key":"Rymcdant3k"}],"identifier":"paso-1-2-escribir-el-c-digo-de-la-aplicaci-n-panel","label":"Paso 1.2: Escribir el código de la aplicación (Panel)","html_id":"paso-1-2-escribir-el-c-digo-de-la-aplicaci-n-panel","implicit":true,"key":"KxJT0YausB"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Crear o editar el script de la aplicación. Para este manual, usaremos el simulador básico de señales en utils/toy_app.py:","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"key":"oZQ6yS72dk"}],"key":"i5bvw3DtOf"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","value":"# utils/toy_app.py\nimport panel as pn\nimport bokeh.plotting as bkp\nfrom bokeh.models import ColumnDataSource\nimport sympy as sp\nimport numpy as np\n\npn.extension(sizing_mode=\"stretch_width\")\n\nt = sp.Symbol('t', real=True)\nexpr_input = pn.widgets.TextInput(name=\"Señal x(t):\", value=\"sin(2*t) + cos(t)\")\nstatus_text = pn.pane.Markdown(\"\")\nsource = ColumnDataSource(data=dict(t=[], y=[]))\n\nfig = bkp.figure(height=350, title=\"Señal interactiva\", tools=\"pan,wheel_zoom,reset\")\nfig.line('t', 'y', source=source, line_width=2.5)\n\ndef update_signal(event=None):\n    try:\n        parsed_expr = sp.sympify(expr_input.value)\n        f_num = sp.lambdify(t, parsed_expr, modules=[\"numpy\"])\n        t_vals = np.linspace(-5, 5, 500)\n        y_vals = np.nan_to_num(f_num(t_vals), nan=0.0)\n        if np.isscalar(y_vals):\n            y_vals = np.full_like(t_vals, y_vals)\n        source.data = dict(t=t_vals, y=y_vals)\n        status_text.object = \"\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        status_text.object = f\"Error: {str(e)}\"\n\nexpr_input.param.watch(update_signal, 'value')\nupdate_signal()\n\napp = pn.Column(expr_input, status_text, fig)\napp.servable()","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":64,"column":1}},"key":"TbM9Uh0dKb"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":1},"end":{"line":66,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Paso 1.3: Compilar a WebAssembly (Pyodide)","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":1},"end":{"line":66,"column":1}},"key":"bhLFNWJZoy"}],"identifier":"paso-1-3-compilar-a-webassembly-pyodide","label":"Paso 1.3: Compilar a WebAssembly (Pyodide)","html_id":"paso-1-3-compilar-a-webassembly-pyodide","implicit":true,"key":"csyshBMCPr"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":68,"column":1},"end":{"line":68,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Se Debe transformar este código Python en un paquete de recursos web (HTML, JS, Web Workers) para que se ejecute en el navegador. Compilarlo indicando como salida la carpeta public que sde creó en el paso 1.1:","position":{"start":{"line":68,"column":1},"end":{"line":68,"column":1}},"key":"fZtPUOiCoh"}],"key":"fDokd1QZOS"},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","value":"panel convert utils/toy_app.py --to pyodide-worker --out public","position":{"start":{"line":70,"column":1},"end":{"line":72,"column":1}},"key":"WNHseG2tuI"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":74,"column":1},"end":{"line":74,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Verificación